\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/keel-billed-toucan-35407\" title=\"Keel-billed Toucan\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Keel-billed Toucan\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/lipizzaner-horse-21768\" title=\"Lipizzaner Horse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lipizzaner Horse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/major-mitchell-s-cockatoo-35580\" title=\"Major Mitchell&amp;#39;s Cockatoo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Major Mitchell&amp;#39;s Cockatoo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/malamute-36492\" title=\"Malamute\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Malamute\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"119\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/malamute-puppy-36623\" title=\"Malamute Puppy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Malamute Puppy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"109\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/palomino-horse-2588\" title=\"Palomino Horse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Palomino Horse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/pinscher-2578\" title=\"Pinscher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pinscher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/pinscher-puppy-19436\" title=\"Pinscher Puppy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pinscher Puppy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1